    "Χ-Bench",
    "chi-bench"
  ],
  "description": "Benchmark evaluating AI agents on end-to-end, long-horizon, policy-rich healthcare workflow automation. Covers three domains: provider prior authorisation, payer utilisation management, and population care management — 75 single-domain tasks plus 23 end-to-end provider-payer tasks grounded in a 1,279-document Managed Care Operations Handbook and 20 simulated healthcare applications. The best-performing agent (Claude Opus) achieved 28.0% pass@1, reflecting the genuine complexity of real-world healthcare administrative workflows. Code is Apache-2.0; the policy handbook dataset is gated on Hugging Face and requires access approval.",
  "url": "https://github.com/actava-ai/chi-bench",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/actava-ai/chi-bench",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "version": "1.0.1",
