  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The only open benchmark for AI agent performance on healthcare administrative workflows — prior auth, utilisation management, and population care management. Apache-2.0, v1.0.1, arXiv paper (2605.16679). Assess due to vendor-led governance (Actava AI), 26 stars, and a gated policy handbook dataset requiring Hugging Face access approval. The 28% best-agent pass@1 signals genuine task difficulty and benchmark rigour. No equivalent exists in the catalog — relevant for any team building healthcare workflow automation agents.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-24",
